/* AVIS.ARTIFACT
   FILE: avis_cmt_artifacts.defs
   NAME: AVIS_CMT_ARTIFACTS_DEFS
   ROLE: Definition index for all AVIS .artifact template files
          and wrapper mapping for avis_cmt.artifacts

   PURPOSE:
       - Defines the complete set of AVIS template artifacts (.artifact)
       - Establishes the structural purpose of each template
       - Declares avis_cmt.artifacts as the wrapper file
       - Provides a unified reference for template-based generation
       - Distinguishes template artifacts (.artifact) from identity artifacts (.art)

   WRAPPER:
       FILE: avis_cmt.artifacts
       ROLE: Combined master template containing all .artifact structures
       CONTENTS:
           - AVIS.ARTIFACT_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.SUBSYSTEM_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.MODULE_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.EXPORT_TABLE_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.DEPENDENCY_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.LAW_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.REGISTRY_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.DESCRIPTION_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.IDENTITY_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.HISTORY_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.FUTURE_TEMPLATE.artifact
           - AVIS.COMMENT_BLOCK_TEMPLATE.artifact

   TEMPLATE_ARTIFACTS:
       AVIS.ARTIFACT_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.SUBSYSTEM_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.MODULE_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.EXPORT_TABLE_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.DEPENDENCY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.LAW_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.REGISTRY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.DESCRIPTION_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.IDENTITY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.HISTORY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.FUTURE_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.COMMENT_BLOCK_TEMPLATE.artifact

   NOTES:
       - This DEFS file governs template structure only.
       - All .artifact files are templates, not registered AVIS objects.
       - All .art identity artifacts must follow these templates.
       - avis_cmt.artifacts is the canonical wrapper for all templates.
*/
